-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="88" height="24" class="pricing-table__save-section-image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-ae5ccddd><h2 class="pricing-table__save-section-title" data-v-ae5ccddd>Your cheapest way to send parcels</h2><div class="pricing-table__save-section-subheader" data-v-ae5ccddd><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Want to send a parcel for a low price? We’re cheaper than you might think! See how much you can save on all parcels up to 15kg when you choose a <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/parcelshop-delivery" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ParcelShop delivery<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> compared to a home or work address - it’s your cheapest way to send with us!<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Need to get your parcel there faster? Upgrade to <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/our-prices" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Next Day delivery from only 58p<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> extra. Plus, if you drop off before 12pm, we’ll aim to deliver the next working day.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="pricing-table__save-section-buttons-container" data-v-ae5ccddd><!----><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link pricing-table__save-section-button" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/send" data-v-ae5ccddd style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Send a parcel<!--]--></span></a></div></div></div></section><section id="send,-track-and-return-parcels" class="landing-feature-banner landing-feature-banner--standard" data-slice-type="landing_feature_banner" data-slice-variation="fullWidthBanner" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__container" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__image-container" data-v-54256dfc><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6thLpbqstJ9-e91_EVRI_LOCATION_05_62178a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6thLpbqstJ9-e91_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6217.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6thLpbqstJ9-e91_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6217.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6thLpbqstJ9-e91_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6217.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri Courier handing over two parcels to an ecastatic mother and child at their doorstep." width="1000" height="667" class="landing-feature-banner__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--standard landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>Send, track and return parcels</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--standard" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->At Evri, we provide cheap and convenient parcel delivery services, using our network of over <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->18,000 friendly parcel Couriers<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We deliver over <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->800 million packages<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> a year to over <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->220 countries and territories<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> worldwide.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Use our Courier service online to send, track and return your parcels quickly and easily - all in one place. Just choose from our ParcelShops, Lockers or book a Courier Collection.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You can track parcels every step of the way using our website or <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/mobile-app" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->App<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, and full tracking is included as standard with every parcel.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div></section><section id="why-evri?" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral conditional-section-wrapper" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="3ColumnWithoutLinks" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h2><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Why Evri?<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h2><!--]--><div class="article-link-module__section-description" data-v-10a41d36><!--v-if--></div><div class="article-link-module__cards-container" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111362c.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=482%2C0%2C5436%2C3642&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=482%2C0%2C5436%2C3642&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=482%2C0%2C5436%2C3642&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri ParcelShop is in full view with its blue signage and a customer is walking up the accesssbility ramp and holding a parcel." width="1000" height="670" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Complete flexibility<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Send or return your parcels with our network of parcel Couriers, using one of 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers located across the UK. Or, book door-to-door Couriers online for collection throughout the country.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><!----></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TmGZbqstJ9-UAY_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10008473b.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TmGZbqstJ9-UAY_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10008.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=18%2C0%2C8021%2C5374&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TmGZbqstJ9-UAY_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10008.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=18%2C0%2C8021%2C5374&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TmGZbqstJ9-UAY_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10008.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=18%2C0%2C8021%2C5374&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A female courier hands a parcel to a recipient. The recipient, an older woman, is smiling." width="1000" height="670" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->A premium service<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Whether you’re sending or returning a parcel with Evri, you’ll get full tracking and cover for up to £20, free of charge. Plus, you’ll get up to 3 parcel delivery attempts and the option to divert your parcel if needed.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><!----></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69xb5bqstJ9-pU1_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0782c3a9.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69xb5bqstJ9-pU1_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0782.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=18%2C0%2C8155%2C5464&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69xb5bqstJ9-pU1_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0782.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=18%2C0%2C8155%2C5464&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69xb5bqstJ9-pU1_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0782.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=18%2C0%2C8155%2C5464&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri Courier is walking down the street in a residential area with a parcel under his arm." width="1000" height="670" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Cheap courier service<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Whether you’re using Standard or Next Day delivery, send or return a parcel using our handy Courier service, for a low price. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><!----></div></article><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="sending-lots-of-parcels-is-much-faster" class="section-wrapper integrations-block" index="6" data-v-7faeaee1 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper integrations-block__card" data-v-7faeaee1 data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="integrations-block__text-wrapper" data-v-7faeaee1><h2 class="u-font-style-h3 integrations-block__title" data-v-7faeaee1>Sending lots of parcels is much FASTER</h2><p class="integrations-block__desc" data-v-7faeaee1>Sending lots of parcels? Sort them in seconds by connecting your Evri account with eBay, Amazon, Shopify, and more. You can also upload a CSV file - whatever&#39;s easiest! Our bulk integrations tool will save you time and hassle on every parcel.</p></div><!--[--><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link integrations-block__button" data-gtm-track="btn-Evri integrations" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/our-services/bulk-send" data-v-7faeaee1 styl