venient.",[],{"type":172,"text":370,"spans":371},"*Excludes Postable parcels",[],{"dimensions":373,"alt":374,"copyright":51,"url":375,"id":376,"edit":377},{"width":244,"height":271},"An Evri Courier approaching the driveway of a suburban house carrying two parcels","index.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tgAZbqstJ9-e6D_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6028.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=2453%2C1850%2C4481%2C3002&w=1000&h=670","Z6tgAZbqstJ9-e6D",{"x":378,"y":379,"zoom":380,"background":250},2453,1850,1.82,{"link_type":59,"key":382,"url":197},"506e80b1-a18e-4845-8515-f63fecf6a8d0","btn-send a parcel",{"link_type":252},"landing_feature_banner$2ae1525d-b83c-4a9c-8364-e700f7a0ff4b",{"variation":207,"version":13,"items":387,"primary":389,"id":413,"slice_type":255,"slice_label":51},[388],{},{"theme":316,"show_premium_logo":26,"label":51,"label_theme":212,"titleH2":390,"bodyText":391,"image":401,"rightImage":45,"buttonText":407,"buttonLink":408,"buttonDataGtmTrack":411,"primary_button_external":26,"button_secondary":412,"secondary_button_external":26},"Tracked Courier service",[392,395,398],{"type":172,"text":393,"spans":394},"When using Evri’s Courier service to send or return a parcel, you’ll get full tracking included in the cost of postage.",[],{"type":172,"text":396,"spans":397},"On the day of your parcel delivery, you’ll get a 1-hour delivery slot. This means you can plan your day around us.",[],{"type":172,"text":399,"spans":400},"If you’re not going to be in, don’t worry! Our tracking tool lets you divert your parcel or select a ‘Safe Place’ for our parcel Couriers to leave your items",[],{"dimensions":402,"alt":403,"copyright":51,"url":404,"id":405,"edit":406},{"width":244,"height":271},"A customer sat on a sofa in their lounge, holding their tablet and looking at their screen.","index.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6Xs8JbqstJ9-WfG_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5477.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=18%2C0%2C8155%2C5464&w=1000&h=670","Z6Xs8JbqstJ